      "items": [
        {
          "itemCode": "COMPACT_01",
          "content": "我能找出生活中真正重要的事，并去追求它们。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 0,
          "responseSetKey": "compact_agree_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "COMPACT_02",
          "content": "我的一大目标就是摆脱痛苦的情绪。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 1,
          "responseSetKey": "compact_agree_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "COMPACT_03",
          "content": "我匆匆做完有意义的活动，却没有真正留心。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 2,
          "responseSetKey": "compact_agree_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "COMPACT_04",
          "content": "我尽量让自己忙起来，好让那些想法或感受不要冒出来。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 3,
          "responseSetKey": "compact_agree_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "COMPACT_05",
          "content": "我的行为方式与我想要的生活一致。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 4,
          "responseSetKey": "compact_agree_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "COMPACT_06",
          "content": "我陷在自己的想法里，以至于做不成自己最想做的事。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 5,
          "responseSetKey": "compact_agree_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "COMPACT_07",
          "content": "即使有压力，我也基于对自己重要的东西来做选择。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 6,
          "responseSetKey": "compact_agree_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "COMPACT_08",
          "content": "我告诉自己，我不应该有某些念头。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 7,
          "responseSetKey": "compact_agree_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "COMPACT_09",
          "content": "我很难把注意力放在当下正在发生的事上。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 8,
          "responseSetKey": "compact_agree_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "COMPACT_10",
          "content": "我的行为与自己的个人价值观一致。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 9,
          "responseSetKey": "compact_agree_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "COMPACT_11",
          "content": "我刻意回避那些可能带来困难想法、感受或身体感觉的情境。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 10,
          "responseSetKey": "compact_agree_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "COMPACT_12",
          "content": "即使在做对自己重要的事，我也会发现自己心不在焉。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 11,
          "responseSetKey": "compact_agree_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "COMPACT_13",
          "content": "我愿意完整地体验出现的一切想法、感受和身体感觉，不去改变或防御它们。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 12,
          "responseSetKey": "compact_agree_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "COMPACT_14",
          "content": "即使困难，我也会去做对自己有意义的事。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 13,
          "responseSetKey": "compact_agree_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "COMPACT_15",
          "content": "我很努力地把难受的感受挡在外面。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 14,
          "responseSetKey": "compact_agree_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "COMPACT_16",
          "content": "我自动化地完成任务，意识不到自己在做什么。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 15,
          "responseSetKey": "compact_agree_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "COMPACT_17",
          "content": "即使进展缓慢，我也能坚持执行自己的长期计划。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 16,
          "responseSetKey": "compact_agree_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "COMPACT_18",
          "content": "即使一件事对我重要，只要它可能让我难受，我就很少去做。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 17,
          "responseSetKey": "compact_agree_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "COMPACT_19",
          "content": "我好像在“自动运行”，不太觉察自己在做什么。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 18,
          "responseSetKey": "compact_agree_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "COMPACT_20",
          "content": "想法只是想法——它们控制不了我的行动。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 19,
          "responseSetKey": "compact_agree_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "COMPACT_21",
          "content": "我的价值观确实体现在我的行为里。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 20,
          "responseSetKey": "compact_agree_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "COMPACT_22",
          "content": "我能让想法和感受自然来去，不试图控制或回避它们。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 21,
          "responseSetKey": "compact_agree_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "COMPACT_23",
          "content": "只要事情对我重要，我就能坚持做下去。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 22,
          "responseSetKey": "compact_agree_0_6",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        }
      ],
